# Evolving Websites 

#### Take a look at the two versions of the Amazon website — one from around 2000 and one from today.
Spend a moment comparing them.

<div style="display: flex; gap: 20px; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; max-width: 1000px; margin: auto;">
    
    <!-- Left image takes 2/3 width -->
